The read guard is dropped before `self.get(host)`, and nothing re-checks the map under the write guard. Callers are concurrent: `Router::forward` (crates/fleet-daemon/src/services/router/mod.rs:135) runs on the daemon connection's `FuturesUnordered` pool, `Mirror::reconcile` (crates/fleet-daemon/src/services/mirror.rs:67) runs on a periodic task, and `Router::start_event_pumps` (router/mod.rs:235) runs at startup.

